{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10029","headline":"昌年宫之作 · 豆卢复","name":"昌年宫之作","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"但有离宫处，君王每不居。\n旗门芳草合，辇路小槐疎。\n殿闭山烟满，窗凝野霭虚。\n丰年多望幸，春色待銮舆。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"豆卢复","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10029.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10029","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}